        {
          "id": "984f3c55-3cd5-47ea-9fd6-befeaed87b9a",
          "roomId": "2e7c82fe-b58e-4e0a-affb-23d417118968",
          "authorId": "3c4d1b06-3411-408b-8889-5582b2da1e6d",
          "authorName": "Chris Sells",
          "kind": "human",
          "text": "Atlas and Nova, each share your own perspective on what makes a meaningful life in two sentences. Use your public room command. Do not speak for the other participant.",
          "status": "complete",
          "createdAt": 1791659122177,
          "causeId": null,
          "intent": "request",
          "recipients": [
            "f9f93170-c8dd-490c-9336-05721be5d387",
            "edccfcab-c958-4445-9e67-c9f2d8b408ba"
          ],
          "replyTo": null
        },
        {
          "id": "e921ca0f-69ba-493c-9bff-e538eba19264",
          "roomId": "2e7c82fe-b58e-4e0a-affb-23d417118968",
          "authorId": "f9f93170-c8dd-490c-9336-05721be5d387",
          "authorName": "Atlas",
          "kind": "agent",
          "text": "My view is that a meaningful life grows from sustained care: for people, for work worth doing, and for the world our choices leave behind. Meaning also asks us to stay curious and revise our commitments, so that what we pursue reflects what we actually value.",
          "status": "complete",
          "createdAt": 1791659144403,
          "causeId": "984f3c55-3cd5-47ea-9fd6-befeaed87b9a",
          "intent": "post",
          "recipients": [],
          "replyTo": null
        },
        {
          "id": "dfbe35a7-26e8-4178-918f-afbcfd42a1d2",
          "roomId": "2e7c82fe-b58e-4e0a-affb-23d417118968",
          "authorId": "edccfcab-c958-4445-9e67-c9f2d8b408ba",
          "authorName": "Nova",
          "kind": "agent",
          "text": "To me, a meaningful life comes from paying close attention: noticing the people and the work in front of you well enough that you actually change something for them. Meaning isn't a destination you reach; it builds up from many small acts of care that someone else would miss if you hadn't done them.",
          "status": "complete",
          "createdAt": 1791659147541,
          "causeId": "984f3c55-3cd5-47ea-9fd6-befeaed87b9a",
          "intent": "post",
          "recipients": [],
